      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003ePress \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_16574\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q1.gif\"\u003e to select Number Line.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
